WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.300
Welcome to Austria, babe.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.520
It's cold...

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:19.400
Yeah.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.380
Isn't there summer?

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:21.980
Uhuh.

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:27.920
I can't wait for you to meet the neighbors.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.920
Come on! Let's see with my mum.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:33.320
Yeah...

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.640
- Johannes!
- Mummy!

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:47.280
Hello.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:15.200
What are you doing? Come on.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:17.040
I don't know what she said...

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.480
Oh my gosh, who is it?!

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:25.560
Oh, yeah, that's Kora, she's the most loving dog ever.

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:26.220
Right?

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:27.720
Do you have treat I can give her?

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.560
Nein! /german/

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:29.940
She's on diet.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:31.840
Oh... okay, why?

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:34.300
She can't walk upstairs.

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:35.440
Yeah.

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.620
How old is she?

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:37.500
Eighteen.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:39.280
- In human years?
- Yes!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.320
I'm sorry.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.440
Welcome.

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:51.860
What would you like to eat?

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:54.120
Oh, uhm... just something small.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:54.980
Okay.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:06.980
So...

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:11.320
...enjoy your meal.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.440
Is she gonna eat with us?

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.580
No, she doesn't eat.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:15.080
Oh...

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:15.740
Okay...

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.460
Looks good.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.820
Would you like any tea or coffee or dessert...?

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.040
Nein! /german/(No!)

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.960
I told you she is on diet!

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:40.420
I'm... sorry...

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:49.960
Done!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.540
How can you disrespect my mum like this?

00:03:24.540 --> 00:03:27.020
She hasn't eaten in two weeks.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.580
She can't even walk upstairs!

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:30.300
She is eighteen years old.

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:32.200
She is too fat.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.140
I know this is gonna work.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:38.000
You're gonna have to learn to love me and understand where I'm coming from!

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:45.560
No!

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.920
Eh... a little, and...

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.440
I don't think it's---

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:57.260
You wear this.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:00.140
I can't do this...

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:09.380
Amanda!

